Review the complete song data and derive removal IDs: a library song must remain exactly when its ID occurs in the liked-song or downloaded-song collection.

```python
original_song_library_ids = {record["song_id"] for record in song_library_records}
liked_song_ids = {record["song_id"] for record in liked_song_records}
downloaded_song_ids = {record["song_id"] for record in downloaded_song_records}
qualifying_song_ids = liked_song_ids | downloaded_song_ids
song_ids_to_remove = sorted(original_song_library_ids - qualifying_song_ids)
expected_song_library_ids = original_song_library_ids - set(song_ids_to_remove)
print({"song_remove_count": len(song_ids_to_remove), "song_keep_count": len(expected_song_library_ids)})
```

Review album eligibility before mutation. A library album qualifies if it is liked or if every song ID listed for that album occurs in the complete downloaded-song set.

